' The mouse wheel (`ManualWindow.OnMouseWheel`, ManualWindow.cs:840-844):
' run with `preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`. The manual a new game
' opens scrolls a line a turn while the pointer is over it, and not when
' it is beside it; Down at the keys does the same, for comparison. The
' Saves list's wheel (OptionsSavesPage.cs:225) is the unit test
' `the_wheel_scrolls_the_saves_list`.
wait 5
press right              ' SURVIVE: longer than the window
snap wheel_manual_top
wheel -1 160,100         ' over the window: a line down
wheel -1 160,100
snap wheel_manual_two
wheel 1 160,100          ' back up one
snap wheel_manual_one
wheel -1 4,100           ' beside the window (it is 300 wide, centred): nothing
snap wheel_manual_beside
press down               ' the key, as the wheel
snap wheel_manual_key
press escape
quit
